          "Cluster of Gaya-era tombs from the Three Kingdoms period, home to the Bokcheon Museum."
        ],
        "금강공원": [
          "Geumgang Park",
          "Park in the Dongnae hot spring district with the Geumgang Botanical Garden."
        ]
